  "notes": [
    "patch_softmute.s, patch_mutemode.s, manifest.py and runtime.json are the author's files byte for byte at the pinned commit, from modwerk-modules/mute-modes/, the author's own Modwerk copy (the 0.2.1 sources with Modwerk's MODWERK_EVENTS blocks, plus this version's changes). upstream/README.md, LICENSE and upstream/OCTABAM_LICENSE are unchanged from 0.1.0's record.",
    "0.2.3 answers the base's raised ev_trig_muted (Modwerk #777): mm_trig_muted applies fresh_bind's per-track test to the whole MUTE_STATE at once (muted tracks, or every unsoloed track while any is soloed, less the SIDE-CHAIN key tracks in KEYMASK), at most 16 instructions per ask; OT and OTFX answer 0. loader_mute_keep_fixture checks it against the resets mm_voice_bind drops in every frame. runtime.json subscribes it at order 50. The code sits under MODWERK_EVENTS only: the native units (plain 996 B, SC_KEY 1106 B) and every author reference are unchanged.",
    "The stock guard digests are 0.1.0's; no hook site changed."
